OL,5,G1845 UEFA Nations League: England v
OL,6,G     Spain
OL,7,     FEngland v Spain (Kick-off 7.45pm).
OL,8,     FMark Pougatch presents coverage of
OL,9,     Fboth teams' opening Group A3
OL,10,     Fmatch, held at Wembley Stadium.
OL,11,     FEngland won promotion to the top
OL,12,     Fdivision in the 2024/25 campaign
OL,13,     Fby topping a group containing
OL,14,     FGreece, Republic of Ireland and
OL,15,     FFinland, and go into this match on
OL,16,     Fthe back of finishing third in the
OL,17,     Fsummer's World Cup. However, they
OL,18,     Fface a stern test against the
OL,19,     FSpaniards, who were crowned world
OL,20,     Fchampions in the summer, and
OL,21,     Freached the final of this
OL,22,     Fcompetition last time out, only
