OL,5,G0325 Gary Barlow's Food and Wine Tour:
OL,6,G     New Zealand
OL,7,     FGary and Jason Manford head to
OL,8,     FHavelock, gateway to the
OL,9,     FMarlborough Sounds, where local
OL,10,     Fseafood entrepreneur Maegan Blom
OL,11,     Ftakes them through a spectacular
OL,12,     Fmaze of sheltered waterways,
OL,13,     Fforested hills and peaceful bays.
OL,14,     FThey drop anchor at her working
OL,15,     Fmussel farm to see how greenshell
OL,16,     Fmussels are grown, before heading
OL,17,     Fback to shore for meal. Then they
OL,18,     Fdrive their camper van to Picton
OL,19,     Fto board a ferry for the scenic
OL,20,     FCook Strait crossing from the
OL,21,     FSouth Island to the North Island,
OL,22,     Fheading up to the bridge to meet
OL,23,VppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppG5/6
