OL,6,     FDaily escape designed to calm the
OL,7,     Fmind and encourage relaxation and
OL,8,     Freflection
OL,9,G0505 The Joy of Pets
OL,10,     FGaby Roslin and vet Bolu Eso are
OL,11,     Fin Birmingham celebrating the
OL,12,     Fextraordinary bond between people
OL,13,     Fand animals. At a specialist
OL,14,     Fveterinary hospital, Bolu follows
OL,15,     FLabrador Bobbie as he undergoes
OL,16,     Fpioneering laser surgery, while
OL,17,     Fanother dog presents the team with
OL,18,     Fa neurological mystery. Gaby
OL,19,     Flearns about StreetVet, the
OL,20,     Fcharity providing free veterinary
OL,21,     Fcare to the pets of people
OL,22,     Fexperiencing homelessness
